sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as EntraCloudCon 10.0.0.15
    participant A as Network Insight API 10.0.0.44
    participant M as Accepted monitor
    participant B as Banner verifier

    W->>W: Read protected shared key
    W->>A: GET manifest with request timestamp and HMAC
    A->>A: Require source IP, Host, no XFF, fresh request HMAC
    alt Network guard fails
        A-->>W: 404 Not found
    else Request authentication fails
        A-->>W: 401 Invalid authentication
    else Request is authenticated
        A->>M: Read accepted cohort and observations
        A->>B: Read fresh live Banner username and person EID proof
        A->>A: Join unique Banner ID, username, person, and EID
        Note over A: Never derive or truncate BannerUserName<br/>CanvasLogin remains observation or null
        alt Sources stale or no usable authority
            A-->>W: 503 Manifest unavailable
        else At least one row is usable
            A->>A: Serialize exact schema v2 UTF-8 body
            A->>A: SHA-256 body and HMAC request time plus response time plus hash
            A-->>W: Raw body plus signed response headers
            W->>W: Verify freshness, body hash, and HMAC before JSON parsing
            W->>W: Recheck schema, row freshness, linkage, uniqueness, observations
        end
    end
